### 1. READ ALL Employees from MongoDB (GET)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees

###

### 2. READ ONE Employee by ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees/101

###

### 3. READ Non-existent Employee (GET 404 test)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees/999

###

### 4. CREATE a New Employee in MongoDB (POST)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 103,
  "name": "Charlie Brown",
  "department": "Finance",
  "salary": 85000
}

###

### 5. UPDATE an Employee in MongoDB (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/employees/101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 101,
  "name": "Alice Johnson",
  "department": "Engineering Lead",
  "salary": 98000
}

###

### 6. DELETE an Employee from MongoDB (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5050/api/employees/102
